{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕張全握"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/05/6149459/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃいお団子にしてみた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/05/6149459/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなり好評でしたー嬉しい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブのセトリ\n♪ガールズルール\n♪扇風機\n♪他の星から\n♪走れ！Bicycle(二期生)\n♪会いたかったかもしれない(二期生)\n♪コウモリよ\n♪世界で一番孤独なLover\n♪人間という楽器"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生初パフォーマンスも\n人間という楽器を初披露も\n更に8月生誕祭も...\n今日は豪華なミニライブでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/05/6149459/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現在ノギカメラを担当してるので、\n山中湖と今日の全握で\n良い写真いっぱい撮れましたよ。\nお楽しみにー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/05/6149459/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/05/6149459/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手レーンはらりんと。\n前にも一緒だったことあるんだよ♪\nらりん一家のみなさん\n優しくて面白い方ばかり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会のみなさん、\n初めましてのみなさんも\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんと爆笑してた笑\nだから余計にハイテンションで\n握手が楽しかったです。\nたぶん一番元気なレーンだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/05/6149459/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/05/6149459/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に楽しかったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/05/6149459/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}